        "Massimo Tornatore"
      ],
      "year": 2026,
      "venue": "Journal of Optical Communications and Networking",
      "venue_abbr": "JOCN",
      "rank_label": "CIE T2 · 2023",
      "keywords": [
        "metro networks",
        "optical transport networks",
        "wavelength division multiplexing"
      ],
      "url": "https://doi.org/10.1364/jocn.596279",
      "cited_by_count": 0,
      "importance": 1,
      "score_basis": {},
      "role": "root",
      "reading_url": "items/d848c3ad-8637-49a8-9ac3-9817254ed0ea.html",
      "summary": "该研究通过数值分析，比较可编程无滤波光网络（PFON）、无滤波光网络（FON）和传统波长交换光网络（WSON）在多层OTN-over-WDM城域网络中的设备部署成本。PFON采用无源分路器、耦合器与可重配置光开关，并结合OTN层不同汇聚板卡及复用转发器的约束分析业务疏导。在三个网络实例及按小时变化的业务模型下，摘要报告PFON相对FON和WSON基线可实现最高31%的设备成本节省。",
      "summary_basis": "本站解读 · abstract-only"
    },
